Description:

Calendar alarm notifications are no longer sent to a sharee whose access to
the calendar has been revoked.  A subscription to a shared calendar can
outlive the ACL grant that led to it, and alarm delivery previously checked
only the subscription, so a former sharee kept receiving alarm notifications
carrying current event data after their access was removed.


